  potentialProfiles:
  - traits: 1
    description: "#Name# keeps #pronoun-possessive# cool in the most tense of situations.
      It\u2019s the singular trait that makes #pronoun-object# so effective at #pronoun-possessive#
      job."
  - traits: 2
    description: "#Name# is often in a sour mood. #Pronoun-subject#\u2019ll follow
      orders, but #pronoun-subject# will probably make a stink about it."
  - traits: 4
    description: '#Name# is a light-hearted individual with a tendency to inject
      a bit of humor into most situations. #Pronoun-possessive# addition to the team
      often keeps others grounded and relieves tensions.'
  - traits: 36
    description: "#Name# is playful with language. If #pronoun-subject# isn\u2019t
      cracking a joke, #pronoun-subject#\u2019s likely to be making some colorful
      remark."
  - traits: 16
    description: You can always count on #Name# to be straight up. #Pronoun-subject#
      tells it like it is, no fluff.
  - traits: 24
    description: '#Name# says what #pronoun-subject# means and means what #pronoun-subject#
      says. Executing the mission is #pronoun-possessive# sole focus.'
  - traits: 32
    description: "#Name# has a way with words. If there\u2019s an opportunity to
      add a bit of flourish to #pronoun-possessive# remarks, #pronoun-subject#\u2019ll
      often take it."
  - traits: 64
    description: '#Name# has a knack for seeing the bright side of things. Hope can
      be so precious in such dire times.'
  - traits: 128
    description: '#Name# often maintains a rather dour outlook. It may kill the mood
      sometimes, but anticipating the worst is what has kept #pronoun-object# alive
      this long.'
  - traits: 8
    description: '#Name# understands the seriousness of the mission. These infected
      mechs may be limited to fringe planets for now, but #pronoun-subject# knows
      how bad things can get if they make their way to more populous sectors.'
  - traits: 512
    description: For #Name#, this mission is personal. #Pronoun-subject# has lost
      friends and family to these hacked bots, and #pronoun-subject# is willing to
      do whatever it takes to stop them.
